  "shortName": null,
  "description": "ConFurence East (CF East or CFE) was one of the first major attempts at a full-fledged furry convention on the U.S. East Coast. It was chaired by Trish Ny, who had earlier organized a prototype furry convention in Philadelphia in 1994 called Furtasticon. The first ConFurence East was held in October 1995 in Elizabeth, New Jersey, and the second in November 1996 near Cleveland, Ohio. A third edition, renamed MoreFurCon, was planned for 1997 but did not take place.",
